# Kimi Code: skills are invoked as /skill:<name>; the context file is AGENTS.md;
# no per-subagent model hint, so the tier clause is dropped (conventions §10.8); the
# question tool's multi-select field is snake_case.
CLAUDE\.md	AGENTS.md
CLAUDE	AGENTS
, `model:` the (?:READ|EXEC|PLAN) tier value the opening load returned, omitted when that key is empty	
、`model:` 取开场装载返回的 (?:READ|EXEC|PLAN) 档值，该键为空时不带这个参数	
; `model:` the EXEC tier value the opening load returned, the READ tier value for that read-only case, omitted when the key is empty	
；`model:` 取开场装载返回的 EXEC 档值，只读勘察那种情况取 READ 档值，键为空时不带这个参数	
, unless the EXEC tier value the opening load returned is non-empty, in which case it names that	
;开场装载返回的 EXEC 档值非空时改为指定那个值	
`Explore` only for read-only orientation	`explore` only for read-only orientation
or `Explore` when the step is read-only orientation	or `explore` when the step is read-only orientation
只读勘察可用 `Explore`	只读勘察可用 `explore`
multiSelect	multi_select
subagent_type: Explore	subagent_type: explore
subagent_type: general-purpose	subagent_type: coder
headless or scripted runs	non-interactive `kimi -p` runs, no human to answer
headless / scripted	non-interactive `kimi -p`, no human to answer
无人值守 / 脚本化	非交互 `kimi -p` 下，无人应答
